ircam-viewer (1.0.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Make Tiny1B UVC shutter controls model-specific.
  * Add USB VID/PID matching so 0bda:3901 gets the Tiny1B descriptor.
  * Apply Kelvin x16 temperature scaling only to Tiny1B; keep x64 for others.
  * Keep 90-degree rotation and Celsius default unchanged.

